                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Tiyi win ma ndelo aucel, to i ndelo mar'abirio wiripo ywomirok, ŋey ŋecin mewin gi jopath ma jotiyo riwin, kiri g'ogwaŋe mewin bende jowoywomere.”",
          "type": "text",
