        {
          "text": "I dwe ma Abib, dwe ma wieye iye wok Misir, tim win kalima ma mugat ma buthow paka amiyo win or. Wikiri wicam mugat moro je gi thow i hongo ma ndelo abirio ma kalima me. Wongoye ŋata wobin laman m'ongoye mic.”",
          "type": "text",
